   * Also after dispatch, vehicle becomes available again (effect of execute_schedule_dispatch). Good.

- For origin_availability_alpha and destination_availability_alpha:
   * After they are locked (and thus origin_availability_confirmed etc), we need to make them dispatch_ready via mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready and mark_destination_availability_dispatch_ready.
