   * So sequence: lock origin, lock destination, assemble leg, authorize loading, then mark origin dispatch ready, mark destination dispatch ready.
   * Then allocate dispatch slot for origin_availability_alpha: allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate origin_availability_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha (note action expects ?candidate - candidate_entity, ?dispatch_slot, ?route_task_profile). Precondition: dispatch_ready ?candidate, candidate_task_profile_linked ?candidate ?route_task_profile, dispatch_slot_available, not dispatch_allocated.
   * Then execute_origin_dispatch origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_? dispatch_slot_alpha.
